====== TP-Link TL-WDR3500 ======
Dual Band (concurrent) and 100Mbps Ethernet.
Advertised as 600 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 GHz Band and Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 5 GHz Band.


