==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====

^ Port    ^ Switch port   ^
| CPU     | 0             |
| LAN 1   | 4             |
| LAN 2   | 3             |
| LAN 3   | 2             |
| LAN 4   | 1             |

The "Ports" above are the port numbers as designated on the case.

Physical interface ''eth0'' is connected to the switch.

WAN port is on separate physical interface ''eth1''.


